That does the deep dive into that,

00:01:28,260 --> 00:01:32,760
that would really be for immune dysfunction patients.

00:01:32,760 --> 00:01:34,760
That would be autoimmune issues,

00:01:34,760 --> 00:01:38,760
not really even beneficial for cancer patients.

00:01:38,760 --> 00:01:41,760
The reason is that, yes,

00:01:41,760 --> 00:01:46,260
you could have elevated or suppressed immune function,

00:01:46,260 --> 00:01:50,260
most likely due to either current infection

00:01:50,260 --> 00:01:52,760
or an autoimmune disorder.

00:01:52,760 --> 00:01:56,260
Having 228, you're right in the middle, that's normal.

00:01:56,260 --> 00:01:59,260
It would only be, you know, you could take all the immune,

00:01:59,260 --> 00:02:02,260
you could take bottles of immune stimulating supplements

00:02:02,260 --> 00:02:05,260
and it's probably not going to increase your natural killer cells.

00:02:05,260 --> 00:02:07,260
Because your body has a balance

00:02:07,260 --> 00:02:09,260
of what it's trying to achieve.

00:02:09,260 --> 00:02:11,260
You can't artificially change that,

00:02:11,260 --> 00:02:14,260
because you're fighting a disease.

00:02:14,260 --> 00:02:17,760
So you can support it so that your body can make,

00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:20,260
so it's not depressed, so that it's not,

00:02:20,260 --> 00:02:24,260
so it's able to keep up the demand that your body's making,

00:02:24,260 --> 00:02:27,260
but you can't just take a whole bunch of immune stimulation,

00:02:27,260 --> 00:02:32,260
think that your white blood cell count is going to be elevated

00:02:32,260 --> 00:02:34,260
by simply doing that.

00:02:34,260 --> 00:02:38,260
So no, it's usually because you're fighting something

00:02:38,260 --> 00:02:43,260
or it's maybe you could also be in a hyper-response

00:02:43,260 --> 00:02:46,260
in an autoimmune situation

00:02:46,260 --> 00:02:49,260
or if it's suppressed, depressed,

00:02:49,260 --> 00:02:54,260
